-**Backward Inputs:**
-- `grad_output`: Gradient of the loss with respect to the forward outputs (`pbr`, `incident_dirs`, `diffuse_light`).
-
-**Backward Outputs:**
-- Tuple of gradients corresponding to the forward inputs. Unused inputs receive `None`.
+**Outputs:**
+The forward pass returns the rendered image tensor (e.g., `pbr` or `rgb`), `incident_dirs`, and `diffuse_light` (for PBR) or `depth`, `ws` (weight), and `total_samples` (for general volume rendering) [S1, S2, unofficial].
 
